23
00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:16.984
Active bookings are disjoint, so sorted by start they are also sorted by end; a new booking can

24
00:02:16.984 --> 00:02:18.926
only conflict with its immediate neighbours.

25
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:26.059
Keep parallel starts and ends lists in sorted order, and a dictionary from id to start. For book,

26
00:02:26.059 --> 00:02:32.685
bisect_left finds the insertion position; check the predecessor and successor for the cleaning gap, then insert

27
00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:38.824
